<title>USA: LoJack increases size of buyback program.</title>
<headline>LoJack increases size of buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>DEDHAM, Mass. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>LoJack Corp said its board has authorized an increase in the number of shares it may purchase under its stock repurchase program to 5,200,000 from 3,200,000.</p>
<p>LoJack has repurchased 3,065,000 shares pursuant to the program.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to continue this repurchase program in open market transactions, from time to time, depending on the price of its stock.</p>
</text>
